      "- Clear client-centered purpose\n- Low-intensity, incidental, or unavoidable contact\n- Viable alternatives considered\n- Transparent discussion and informed choice\n- Specific limits and exit procedures\n- Consultation or supervision\n- Careful documentation\n- Ongoing monitoring for changed risk\n- No counselor gain beyond ordinary professional benefit\n- Cultural and community fit explored with the client",
