    "whyItMatters": "Financial and gift questions are difficult because the ethical answer is often neither an absolute ban nor unrestricted client choice. A small culturally meaningful gift may be appropriate; a large gift tied to approval may be exploitative. Bartering is permitted under the ACA code only under stated conditions. Fees and collection practices must be transparent, and financial incentives must not corrupt referral or clinical judgment.",
