    "whyItMatters": "Supervision and consultation both improve decisions, but they are not interchangeable. Supervision includes an ongoing, evaluative, power-bearing responsibility for client welfare and supervisee development. Consultation ordinarily provides specialized input while the consultee retains authority and responsibility. Calling a colleague does not convert consultation into licensure supervision.",
